# babel.packages — the languages an author can select with `lang:`
#
# Installed with the base closure, listed explicitly: collection-lang* would
# drag in hundreds of MB of docs and fonts for the same coverage. Non-Latin
# scripts (CJK, Arabic, Indic) are out of scope — they need fonts this image
# does not carry.
#
# Every language here needs its hyphenation pattern in hyphen.packages, under
# the name TeX Live gives it there.
#
# `README.md` in the directory above owns the row format.

babel
babel-basque
babel-czech
babel-danish
babel-dutch
babel-english
babel-finnish
babel-french
babel-german
babel-hungarian
babel-italian
babel-norsk
babel-polish
babel-portuges
babel-spanish
babel-swedish
